        Drive east on I-80. We handle the rest — Golf Digest Top 100 tee times, lodging,
        and Saturday dinner at the Frank Lloyd Wright lodge.
        Your crew shows up, plays great golf, and argues about handicaps on the drive home.
        That's the whole plan. One contract.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__btns">
        <a href="/request-a-quote/?from=bay-area-golf-trip&type=weekend&placement=hero" class="btn-gold">Get a Free Itinerary → 24h</a>
        <a href="#past-trips" class="btn-ghost">See Trips We've Run</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__proof">
        <span>★ 4.8 / 5 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 672 reviews</span>
        <span class="sep">|</span>
        <span>Groups 8–20</span>
        <span class="sep">|</span>
        <span>19+ Graeagle Trips via TripsCaddie</span>
        <span class="sep">|</span>
        <span>Since 2004</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BAR -->
  <div class="trust-bar">
    <div class="trust-bar__scroll">
      <span class="ti"><strong>3.5h from SF</strong> I-80 E → Hwy 89 N</span>
      <span class="ti-sep">·</span>
