            <strong>You share an invitation link with your group.</strong>
            Each person registers themselves, sees the full trip details, and pays their own share directly.
            No Venmo chasing. No spreadsheet. No follow-up texts.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Tee times are confirmed before anyone books travel.</strong>
            Everything is locked before a single person puts the dates in their calendar.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Everyone gets their itinerary automatically.</strong>
            Tee times, lodging confirmation, dinner time at Fifty44 — it all lands in their inbox.
